{% comment %}
批语 piyu：横排大字金句（朱雀仿宋，小红书与方形取 title 档），开头引号悬挂到行首之外（只用开引号），句中「250 万年」下一道朱笔；落款前用破折号，楷书 ink-2；品牌小字在底边。
朱色：仅下划线。小红书与方形左缘 100px、字距 -.035em，让悬挂的开引号离画布边至少 48px。划线位置按本句换行（title 档每行 8 字）用 em 定位；公众号封面取 sub 档两行。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  .hl {
    position: absolute;
    left: 100px;
    top: 400px;
    width: 7.75em;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-title);
  }
  .quote {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: inherit;
    font-family: var(--ds-font-latin), var(--ds-font-cjk-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-indent: -1em;
  }
  .mk { font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk); }
  .stroke {
    position: absolute;
    left: 2.17em;
    top: 3.08em;
    width: 3.55em;
    height: 26px;
    overflow: visible;
    fill: var(--ds-color-zhu);
  }
  .by {
    position: absolute;
    left: 72px;
    right: 48px;
    top: 1020px;
    margin: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: var(--ds-font-kai);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-body);
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
  }
  .by::before { content: "——"; }
  .foot {
    position: absolute;
    left: 72px;
    right: 48px;
    bottom: 72px;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: var(--ds-space-3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule-light);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-caption);
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-3);
  }
  .by:has(> :empty), .foot:has(> :empty) { visibility: hidden; }
  @media (min-aspect-ratio: 9/10) and (max-aspect-ratio: 11/10) {
    .hl { top: 200px; }
    .by { top: 860px; }
  }
  @media (min-aspect-ratio: 2/1) {
    .hl { left: 84px; top: 48px; width: 15.6em; font-size: var(--ds-type-sub); }
    .quote { line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: 0; }
    .stroke { left: 10.25em; top: 1.48em; width: 3.7em; height: 16px; }
    .by { left: 72px; right: 48px; top: 232px; }
    .foot { left: 72px; right: 72px; bottom: 24px; padding-top: var(--ds-space-2); }
  }
</style>
<div class="hl">
  <p class="quote"><span class="mk">“</span>{{ slots.quote }}</p>
  <svg class="stroke" viewBox="0 0 400 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 14C60 8 140 10 214 8S340 8 398 10C344 14 270 17 204 16S70 19 2 14Z"/></svg>
</div>
<p class="by">{{ slots.by }}</p>
<p class="foot">{{ slots.brand }}</p>
